    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minibuilder is a 2d top-down sandbox game with infinite, procedurally generating worlds. Defeat and protect yourself from enemies, acquire materials, build with both solid  and decorative tiles, forage for food, make tools, fight a boss monster, and play with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything has a purpose in this game, whether it be surface level, such as food, or for different recipes, such as sand or uranium. You are able to customize world generation by changing the way the noise itself generates. Multiplayer is fully optional but is fully supported.</p>",
